<h1>StrikeSet: Data &amp; Privacy</h1>
<p class="updated">Last updated: August 2, 2026</p>

<p>
  This page is a plain-language summary of how StrikeSet handles your data and what controls
  you have. For the full legal document, see our
  <a href="https://embaxus.com/strikeset/privacypolicy">Privacy Policy</a>.
</p>

<h2>What We Collect</h2>

<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>Account info</strong> — your email and password (handled securely by Supabase
    Auth — we never see or store your raw password).
  </li>
  <li><strong>Profile info</strong> — username, display name, and chosen avatar.</li>
  <li><strong>Activity data</strong> — your points, streak, skip passes, and saved workout lists.</li>
  <li><strong>Social data</strong> — friends, duel invites, and duel results you take part in.</li>
  <li>
    <strong>Notifications</strong> — a device push-notification token, only if you enable
    push notifications.
  </li>
</ul>

<h2>What We Don't Collect</h2>

<p>
  StrikeSet does <strong>not</strong> collect your location, access your camera or contacts,
  collect payment or financial information, or use any advertising SDKs.
</p>

<h2>How We Use It</h2>

<p>
  To create and run your account, power social features like friends and duels, send you push
  notifications (if enabled), and track your workout progress, points, and streaks.
</p>

<h2>Who We Share It With</h2>

<p>
  We don't sell your data or share it with advertisers. We use two service providers to run
  StrikeSet:
</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Supabase</strong> — our backend, authentication, and database provider.</li>
  <li><strong>Google Firebase Cloud Messaging</strong> — used only to deliver push notifications.</li>
</ul>

<p>
  Anything you choose to share via friends, duels, or leaderboards (username, display name,
  avatar, points, streak) is visible to your friends and, where applicable, on shared
  leaderboards.
</p>

<h2>Your Controls</h2>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Edit your profile</strong> — Profile → Settings → Edit Profile.</li>
  <li><strong>Turn off notifications</strong> — Profile → Settings → Push Notifications.</li>
  <li>
    <strong>Delete your account</strong> — Profile → Settings → Delete Account. This
    permanently and irreversibly removes your account and all associated data.
  </li>
</ul>

<h2>Security</h2>

<p>
  All data is transmitted over encrypted (HTTPS) connections, and our database uses
  row-level security so your data is only ever accessible to you.
</p>

<h2>Questions</h2>

<p>
  Reach us at <a href="mailto:strikesetapp@gmail.com">strikesetapp@gmail.com</a>.
</p>

